重要提示 / Important Notice

本工具默认只读：只读取设备信息、生成报告，不改任何系统设置。
唯一的动作是「重新识别」，等同于设备管理器的「扫描检测硬件改动」。

使用前请注意：本工具给出的是基于 Windows 所报信息的推断，
不是硬件层面的诊断结论。涉及重要数据时，先做数据恢复，再谈修盘。

This tool is read-only by default. It reads device information and writes a
local report; it changes no system setting. The only action it performs is a
hardware rescan, which is the same as "Scan for hardware changes" in Device
Manager. Conclusions are inferences from what Windows reports, not a hardware
level diagnosis. When data matters, recover it first.
